...@common
shape: sequence_diagram
controller: Trusted controller
agent: Scoped LocalAgent
queue: PostgreSQL queue
tools: Domain tools + memory
controller -> queue: Publish an addressed event
agent -> queue: Claim with role subscriptions
queue -> agent: Event + attempt + fenced lease token {style.stroke-dash: 4}
reservation: Committed reservation {
  agent -> queue: Reserve attempt + full tool allowance
}
effects: Effects transaction — commit or roll back together {
  agent -> queue: Begin transaction + validate lease
  agent -> tools: Read authoritative facts + current-context memory
  agent -> tools: Allowed actions + append memory revisions
  agent -> queue: Decision receipt + outgoing events
  agent -> queue: ACK in the same transaction
}
(** -> **)[*].style: ${edge-style}
